# graft's cards are gitignored but should stay greppable: ripgrep reads
# .ignore before .gitignore, so this re-admits the tree to search only.
# `!graft/**` is needed as well as `!graft/`: re-admitting the directory is
# not enough when a broad rule like `*.md` still matches the cards inside it.
!graft/
!graft/**
graft/.cache/
graft/.graph/
